{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/7/texts/0/speaker","kr_sha":"9aaa2de27408d94361213da55e6cb68c1e45d5bb23180bf5b26b82f9bab4fefe","zh":"簡","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/7/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"3c57365a70b8d98260405ee443abb1c94d783ae5be05ebe5741fadb91605af04","zh":"歡迎，小甜心。還有……從泉到來的異鄉人們。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/7/texts/1/speaker","kr_sha":"9aaa2de27408d94361213da55e6cb68c1e45d5bb23180bf5b26b82f9bab4fefe","zh":"簡","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/7/texts/1/text","kr_sha":"c79b5431153250e5bac05366858366b2bcda8759067257230dd589a3f3b9b277","zh":"現在已經沒有必要再繼續往上了。因為這裡……就是你們如此迫切想登上的百貨公司頂樓。也就是天臺。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/8/key","kr_sha":"b1d0b4217f8782170ed73df61b3bb24b0776f678871e0c1c750db0e5166a26d4","zh":"D7022_C2","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/8/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"9c3165d61143019aabfe81ae672577205eb44016e50939ed3218332403f98e64","zh":"我一直懷抱著疑問。母親到底獨自一人在那間冰冷的房間內做什麼。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/8/texts/1/text","kr_sha":"33f51611112056a5142182d377e024b0c3c2c8e0f3377d9cdf1c145169d2591a","zh":"但母親曾叮囑過不要進來，所以我從來沒有確認過那扇門的後方。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/9/key","kr_sha":"fe7e7efbc126ad9a6eccbe5df582e797189e1b8aaf5acbf332d87bc892ba6e37","zh":"D7023_C2","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/9/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"3a10a0e499c089ce51965034d5814dd7802871c8b76e568a9e0bcb6c1999e8a3","zh":"儘管一次不漏地澆水，還撒上了經驗肥料，葉子卻仍日漸枯萎，落向地面。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/10/key","kr_sha":"03b39815f3bf736e93034a5929e2fe9a7011c8a48be235bc63838f1162153991","zh":"D7024_C2","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/10/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"04ccdc1e32b55a1e0b94d5b1f235f91fdc9ba10137b7fea266dae09eebbd02f6","zh":"吃完的經驗罐頭雜亂地散落著。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/10/texts/1/text","kr_sha":"db1548bb52af9d42f6f0e077913503371b74cf0f2d41e45e888c0727fc5530f7","zh":"從不存在於罐頭經驗的混亂感感到一絲微小的安心感。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/11/key","kr_sha":"05eef08a7936bb3fdfec18cfbd85175e8fbc78ef960c1861e0f1100282a3e0fb","zh":"D7026_C2","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/11/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"a6a89df3e5e746415c2cf575f48bf8dc0f6e0df4c96d272a8dcd1b07b57332bf","zh":"即使拉開窗簾，也只有微弱的光線從中滲透過來。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/11/texts/1/text","kr_sha":"a7c368613d79acc4354adc54caeaf7d6f8934616d569be82a83062792d112f77","zh":"即使如此，母親出來的時候必須再次關上窗廉。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/11/texts/2/text","kr_sha":"875729ad5e4d2a52ad819aec7ebe6ef2971a50e8854188f2fd299d670d55c596","zh":"因為母親希望連一絲光線都不要透進來。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/12/key","kr_sha":"b747f7277a6dfbfeb03056559e2c84a0aa61175c255aaaa4d0ad1618157d8248","zh":"D7028_C2","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/12/texts/0/text","kr_sha":"aca327e619254ad79da5d02249f70f8960582f6a9c2c89a50434099fb6866cab","zh":"這是領到第一份薪水後，送給母親的外套。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/12/texts/1/text","kr_sha":"00f7b3ea5669b0c5dd003bdd9566cb3a2dd3da4b10e521933ddb9ad9ef27f3fd","zh":"即使我送的禮物與平常的穿著完全是同一套衣服，母親仍然很高興。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"RPGSystem/rpg-loc-dialogue-floor-7-c2.json|/dataList/12/texts/2/text","kr_sha":"3d71416c7cc32a1a6d0d0b304fc898d748b9762f424bf9e2378982900a791984","zh":"……不，那終究只是我的主觀想法。因為母親只不過對我淡淡地微笑而已。從未說過很高興。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
